<title>JAPAN: Chuo Trust - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chuo Trust - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   182.17		vs	  177.41</p>
<p> Operating	   67.72		vs	   14.48</p>
<p> Current	     30.59		vs	    3.01</p>
